        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 2970, 2-3/4\" Screen Door Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHalf Surface Single Acting Spring Hinge for Screen Doors. Door flange is surface applied to door. Jamb flange is mortised to  door jamb.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 2970 Screen Door Spring Hinge permit doors automatically return to the closed position (Self Closing). Packaged  with #7 x 3/4\" wood mounting screws. The spring tension is not adjustable. If you need an adjustable tension hinge use <a href=\"/products/2-3-4-inch-half-surface-screen-door-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-2930\"><b>Bommer 2930</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer 2970 Screen Door Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Size: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Half Surface</li>\r\n<li>Door flange surface applied</li>\r\n<li>Jamb flange mortised</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2970.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 2970 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/screen-door-hardware\">Screen Door Hardware</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
